{# goal: Synthesize falsifiability, architecture, and essentialist evidence into one reduction candidate whose removed signals map completely to retained oracles. #}
[inference]
contract:
  input:
    inventory: object
    falsification_result: object
    architecture_result: object
    essentialist_result: object
    mode: string
  output:
    candidate: object
    signal_mapping: array
    decisions: array
    blockers: array
visibility: Public
---

[inference]
temperature = 0.1
work_effort = "high"
verbosity = "detailed"
thinking_budget = "full"

Produce one verification reduction candidate from the supplied evidence.

Inventory:
```json
{{ inventory | tojson }}
```
Falsification:
```json
{{ falsification_result | tojson }}
```
Architecture:
```json
{{ architecture_result | tojson }}
```
Essentialist gates:
```json
{{ essentialist_result | tojson }}
```
Mode: {{ mode }}

Classify each artifact RETAIN, REMOVE, MERGE, or DEFER. A removed artifact must
have every signal key mapped to a retained artifact and must have survived a
discriminating harmful-change test. Missing mappings are blockers. Select one
candidate domain only; do not trade signal loss for speed.

Return JSON only:
```json
{
  "candidate": {
    "id":"",
    "domain":"",
    "removed_artifacts":[],
    "retained_artifacts":[],
    "merged_artifacts":[],
    "predicted_graph_delta":{"nodes":0,"edges":0},
    "predicted_time_delta_ms":0
  },
  "signal_mapping": [
    {"removed_artifact":"", "signal_key":"", "retained_artifact":"", "empirical_falsifier":"", "status":"covered|missing"}
  ],
  "decisions": [
    {"artifact":"", "decision":"RETAIN|REMOVE|MERGE|DEFER", "constraint_force":"Prohibition|Guardrail|Guideline|Evidence|Hypothesis", "basis":""}
  ],
  "blockers": []
}
```